##
## Arch Linux repository mirrorlist
##
## Worldwide, geo-routed mirrors maintained by pkgbuild.com. Slate ships
## these uncommented (unlike the stock pacman-mirrorlist package, which
## comments out every entry) so pacman works out of the box on both the
## live ISO and any system installed via archinstall, with no reflector
## run or manual mirror selection required.
##

## Worldwide
Server = https://geo.mirror.pkgbuild.com/$repo/os/$arch
Server = https://fastly.mirror.pkgbuild.com/$repo/os/$arch
